    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Diva in the Woods",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Excellent tourist attraction for visitors from other countries who want to experience southern life (or people from other regions of the US who are curious)! I'm from GA and felt right at home.\n\nMy visit was Feb. 23, 2026 on a Monday afternoon around 3pm. The gift shop is at the entrance and busier ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shannon Smith",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My girlfriends and I visited Florabama a few weeks ago and had an amazing time!!! We had great drinks and food, but the service was impeccable!! 5 ⭐️!  We had the best experience with Stacy! She is the best bartender and conversationalist we’ve ever had the pleasure of meeting! We can’t wait to go b",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Cari Breckenridge",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Amazing atmosphere! Awesome variety of stuff in their gift shop! Was able to not only eat at the yacht club but also attend their Christmas Day potluck! So amazing what all they do for the community! Really good food and great staff! Great location!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jackie Van Matre",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We just celebrated our sister’s 90th b’day at Florabama.  Florabama is this group of 6 sisters favorite “honky Tonk.”  Your awesome staff is incredibly nice from the time you come in the front door until you leave.  We want to give a special shout out to “Stephanie” in the Main Event Room.  She took",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "R Farmland",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "There is so much going on here. Two different bands in two separate bar areas. They start early and it goes on into the night. Sometimes they have famous singer/songwriters performing. We come here every year while on vacation.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
