    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Gary Leemgraven",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Fun place to visit! A \"must\" to be sure. More food than you can eat! The Thrown Rolls are delicious. Fried Okra, black eyed peas, collard greens, macaroni and cheese with tomato sauce, apple butter and molasses. It more like a experience! Been in business since 1942 Hometown Favorite. Tourist spot, ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "ViviAnn Lane",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My new favorite place!!! The ambiance is really nice, the food is really good and the service was the Best! You get it all in this one place!! Our waitress, Monica was so nice and checked on us several times. The food arrived hot and pretty quick! Even all the pass arounds were served hot and tasty!",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rafe Bar",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Really enjoyed everything we got, I recommend the ribeye, the fried chicken was good as well. Seems like a random item but is probably my favorite side is the pickled cucumbers and onions, very good! Cornbread was good as well, and can’t forget the throwed rolls! The rolls pair well with apple butte",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Randall Deaton",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Lambert’s Cafe: A Southern Feast with a Flying Twist\nIf you’re heading to Lambert’s Cafe in Foley, Alabama, you need to come with a massive appetite and keep your head on a swivel. Famously known across the country as the \"Home of the Throwed Rolls,\" this lively and legendary institution is defined ",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rafael Mora",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Enjoyed my food. First time coming. They do throw those delicious bread rolls. The atmosphere is not as comfortable in my experience. This is a straight 4.5 in my book. Delicious southern food with a twist of fun. I would like to come back and try other plates. I would recommend the visit. The only ",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
