      {
        "author": "STLA_1020",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Typical subway experience. Nothing great, nothing bad. Cheap sandwiches that are quick. The workers didn’t seem to be happy to be working but made the sandwiches as asked. If you need a quick lunch and not spend over $20 you can count on Subway.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tabitha McLaughlin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The restaurant is right across from our hotel.  The staff was friendly and the business was very clean.  We ate there several times during our vacation.  The food was very good.   I highly recommend this business and we will definitely be returning on our next vacation.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
