        "text": "ABSOLUTELY AWFUL. i went and got bacon i did not want my bread toasted and the women gave me UNCOOKED BACON then said it wasn’t her fault because of me not saying to cook the bacon i shouldn’t have to ask. will not go back .",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
